      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "executive summary",
      "narration_text": "An embedding model turns text into a vector — a list of numbers. Train it so similar meaning lands close together. Then 'search' becomes 'find the nearest points.'",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 15,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B01_BLUF",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B01.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.24,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B01.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B01_BLUF",
        "at": "2026-08-31T10:56:51"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "framework",
      "narration_text": "Picture a 2D map instead of hundreds of dimensions. Words with related meaning land near each other — dog and puppy cluster together, car and truck cluster somewhere else entirely. Distance on this map is semantic similarity.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 17,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B02_Framework",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 13.15,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B02_Framework",
        "at": "2026-08-31T10:56:51"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "worked example",
      "narration_text": "Drop in a query point. The nearest neighbors are just the closest dots, measured by distance, not by word overlap. 'Puppy' lands near 'dog' even though they don't share a single letter.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 16,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B03_Query",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.13,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B03.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B03_Query",
        "at": "2026-08-31T10:56:51"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "mechanism at scale",
      "narration_text": "Checking every point works for a thousand vectors. At a billion, that's too slow. Approximate methods build a graph over the points — hop through a few connections toward the query's neighborhood, and skip almost everything else.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 17,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B04_BruteVsANN",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 12.19,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B04.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B04_BruteVsANN",
        "at": "2026-08-31T10:56:51"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "falsifiability",
      "narration_text": "The word is approximate for a reason: this can miss the true nearest neighbor. It's a real trade-off — faster search costs some accuracy, tuned by how much of the graph you're willing to explore.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 16,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B05_Recall",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B05.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.51,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B05.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B05_Recall",
        "at": "2026-08-31T10:56:51"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "verdict",
      "narration_text": "Verdict: embeddings turn meaning into geometry, and that's genuinely powerful. But the search that makes it fast at scale is approximate by design — recall, latency, and memory are one knob, not three separate wins.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 16,
      "shot": {
        "type": "REMOTION",
        "remotion": {
